cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or pipeline in your work, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  MVA Hackathon 2026: N-of-1 variant prioritization and drug repurposing
  for BUB1B mosaic variegated aneuploidy
authors:
  - family-names: Pise
    given-names: Nikhil Pravin
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/nikhilpravinpise/MVA-Hackathon-2026
keywords:
  - rare disease
  - mosaic variegated aneuploidy
  - BUB1B
  - variant prioritization
  - drug repurposing
  - bioinformatics
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, leak-firewalled N-of-1 variant-prioritization funnel
  (Track 1, verified 100.0/1.000 on the official scorer) and a
  gene-agnostic drug-repurposing engine (Track 2) producing a ranked,
  pediatric-label-checked portfolio of approved medicines for a BUB1B
  mosaic variegated aneuploidy proband. All reports are generated from
  committed evidence artifacts; every citation is resolved live and
  retraction-checked.
date-released: 2026-10-21
